      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Spontaneous coronary artery dissections are relatively uncommon. Many of the previously reported cases have involved a dissection in a single coronary artery of a peripartum or postpartum female. We describe an unusual case of multiple spontaneous coronary dissections in a middle-aged male."},
